ve that increases piece activity\n\n**Reason:** Knight to d4 is the strongest move because it centralizes my most active piece with tempo (attacking the queen), dominates a key central square, and creates immediate tactical threats against White's exposed king position on f2.\n\n**Answer:** N: c6-d4"}
